[Script]

[Remote Script]
https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/fmz200/wool_scripts@main/Loon/script/tasks.scripts, tag=定时任务合集@fmz200, enabled=true
https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/fmz200/wool_scripts@main/Loon/script/tools.scripts, tag=脚本工具合集@fmz200, enabled=true

[Plugin]
