https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/ajune0527/vpn_tool@master/Tool/Loon/Plugin/Taobao_remove_ads.plugin, enabled=true
https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/ajune0527/vpn_tool@master/Tool/Loon/Plugin/CoolApk_remove_ads.plugin, enabled=true
