https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/Tartarus2014/Loon-Script@master/Plugin/skip-proxy.lpx, img-url=https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/Orz-3/mini@master/Alpha/Imm.png, enabled=true
https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/VirgilClyne/GetSomeFries@main/plugin/HTTPDNS.Block.plugin, enabled=true
